

sound vo_harp_falcsqcom
{
 description "<Harper/Davenport:> Falcon squad, I'm here to compliment you on your efforts today, your team has pulled off the impossible by getting Strauss back in one piece, and the Strogg data you collected has become essential to the entire war effort, Strauss..."

