sound vo_tak_wefindec
{
 description "<Tak:> We finished decoding the data about the Makron guardian, AKA the Valkaryne?  She is the reason why another Makron appeared so quickly after the first one fell.  Her entire purpose is to awaken a new Makron when one is destroyed.  "

 minDistance 80
 maxDistance 900
 volumeDb 0

 sound/vo/M06_MCC/tak_wefindec.wav
}


sound vo_tak_valkact
{
 description "<Tak:> The Valkaryne acts as a data conduit for a newly awakened Makron.  She filters all the data from the Nexus into a new Makron, making sure the Strogg leadership doesn't skip a beat.  This is even more concerning- since she can filter Nexus information directly, it's possible she doesn't need the Nexus like the other Strogg do.  She can function without it!"

 minDistance 80
 maxDistance 900
 volumeDb 0

 sound/vo/M06_MCC/tak_valkact.wav
}


sound vo_tak_datapoint
{
 description "<Tak:> The data we found  pointed us to a cryogenic facility where perhaps hundreds of Makrons are stored in stasis, if the Nexus assault is successful - the Valkaryne will just awaken another Makron immediately and we'll be back to square one."

 minDistance 80
 maxDistance 900
 volumeDb 0

 sound/vo/M06_MCC/tak_datapoint.wav
}


sound vo_marks_wetrycomm
{
 description "<Markswell:> We've tried to communicate this data to the Nexus assault forces, but the Squib attack has cut off our communication.  So our only chance here is to strike at the Valkaryne where they least expect it.  Inside the Makron Cryogenics facility."

 minDistance 80
 maxDistance 900
 volumeDb 0

 sound/vo/M06_MCC/marks_wetrycomm.wav
}


sound vo_tak_unfortstrgg
{
 description "<Tak:> Unfortunately, the Strogg have already begun to shut down access lines to the Cryogenics facility, like a preemptive action in case they detect that the Makron is danger.  Locking mechanisms are shutting down as we speak."

 minDistance 80
 maxDistance 900
 volumeDb 0

 sound/vo/M06_MCC/tak_unfortstrgg.wav
}


